1
00:01:08,300 --> 00:01:10,800
"Blue Lips"

2
00:01:11,300 --> 00:01:13,800
(Episode 10)

3
00:01:18,379 --> 00:01:19,638
How should I put this?

4
00:01:19,896 --> 00:01:20,729
It's just rotten.

5
00:01:20,920 --> 00:01:22,316
When he was out delivering on his bike,

6
00:01:22,340 --> 00:01:23,559
an old lady fell down.

7
00:01:23,739 --> 00:01:24,159
And him,

8
00:01:24,219 --> 00:01:26,059
he fell too while trying
to avoid hitting her.

9
00:01:26,320 --> 00:01:28,360
Xiao Wu probably didn't even touch her.

10
00:01:28,800 --> 00:01:30,259
But Xiao Wu is an honest guy.

11
00:01:30,260 --> 00:01:31,476
He didn't think too much about it,

12
00:01:31,500 --> 00:01:33,420
and just took her to the
hospital for a checkup.

13
00:01:34,219 --> 00:01:35,519
He ended up getting extorted.

14
00:01:36,280 --> 00:01:38,178
The old lady's son
brought a gang of people,

15
00:01:38,179 --> 00:01:40,376
making a scene at the
courier station where he works.

16
00:01:40,400 --> 00:01:42,280
They completely ruined Xiao Wu's job.

17
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:43,639
After they were done there,

18
00:01:43,760 --> 00:01:45,280
they came to our bar to cause trouble.

19
00:01:46,199 --> 00:01:47,896
He didn't want to bring trouble to the bar,

20
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:49,560
so he hasn't been around for a long time.

21
00:01:49,780 --> 00:01:51,659
He won't even answer our calls.

22
00:02:00,079 --> 00:02:01,079
Hey, Mom.

23
00:02:01,300 --> 00:02:02,300
Mo-mo!

24
00:02:03,139 --> 00:02:04,999
Why did you leave so suddenly?

25
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:06,840
Are you hiding something
from your dad and me?

26
00:02:07,420 --> 00:02:09,219
I had some business in Jinyang.

27
00:02:09,579 --> 00:02:10,979
I had to head back on short notice.

28
00:02:11,219 --> 00:02:12,219
I couldn't stay long.

29
00:02:13,539 --> 00:02:14,860
Was it because I scolded you?

30
00:02:14,980 --> 00:02:17,139
Pushing you to go on blind dates?
Did I hurt your feelings?

31
00:02:17,659 --> 00:02:18,859
It's not what you think.

32
00:02:18,860 --> 00:02:19,860
You're overthinking it.

33
00:02:21,019 --> 00:02:22,279
Well, have you eaten?

34
00:02:22,280 --> 00:02:23,940
Don't leave on an empty stomach.

35
00:02:24,920 --> 00:02:26,738
I just grabbed a quick bite.

36
00:02:26,739 --> 00:02:27,760
Don't worry, I'm fine.

37
00:02:28,639 --> 00:02:29,639
By the way, Mom.

38
00:02:31,800 --> 00:02:32,820
If I...

39
00:02:33,139 --> 00:02:34,820
never get married in this lifetime,

40
00:02:35,320 --> 00:02:36,400
you wouldn't be mad, right?

41
00:02:38,280 --> 00:02:39,280
I won't allow it.

42
00:02:39,880 --> 00:02:40,599
Your dad and I

43
00:02:40,600 --> 00:02:42,260
are going to pass away before you do.

44
00:02:42,679 --> 00:02:43,880
If you don't get married,

45
00:02:44,039 --> 00:02:44,900
once we're gone,

46
00:02:44,901 --> 00:02:46,340
what will you do all by yourself?

47
00:02:48,639 --> 00:02:49,659
Listen to me.

48
00:02:49,920 --> 00:02:51,420
I was just kidding, just teasing you.

49
00:02:52,780 --> 00:02:53,780
Wait for me at home.

50
00:02:53,880 --> 00:02:54,880
I'll be back soon.

51
00:03:38,199 --> 00:03:39,199
Teng Mo, where are you?

52
00:03:39,500 --> 00:03:40,776
Why aren't you answering your phone?

53
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:41,920
Did something happen?

54
00:03:45,360 --> 00:03:46,720
You gave up the lease on the shop.

55
00:03:47,099 --> 00:03:49,179
What on earth made you
leave without saying goodbye?

56
00:03:55,579 --> 00:03:57,159
Teng Mo, you're a jerk!

57
00:03:57,460 --> 00:03:58,460
A total jerk!

58
00:04:07,780 --> 00:04:08,340
Hey, Ah Heng.
Brother Mo.

59
00:04:09,260 --> 00:04:11,400
Do you know where Wu
Shixian's courier station is?

60
00:04:12,179 --> 00:04:13,179
I do.

61
00:04:13,239 --> 00:04:14,239
Are you going there?

62
00:04:14,340 --> 00:04:15,340
Send it to me, thanks.

63
00:04:16,139 --> 00:04:16,400
Okay.

64
00:04:16,519 --> 00:04:17,719
I'll send it to you right now.

65
00:04:20,420 --> 00:04:21,476
You see, in our line of work,

66
00:04:21,500 --> 00:04:22,940
the turnover rate is extremely high.

67
00:04:23,500 --> 00:04:24,900
We usually don't pay much attention

68
00:04:24,980 --> 00:04:26,599
to their home addresses and stuff.

69
00:04:26,860 --> 00:04:28,718
So on our end,

70
00:04:28,719 --> 00:04:29,960
we only register

71
00:04:30,519 --> 00:04:31,719
the street they live on.

72
00:04:32,860 --> 00:04:33,900
Let me look it up for you.

73
00:04:37,199 --> 00:04:38,199
Here you go.

74
00:04:41,960 --> 00:04:42,960
Him, well...

75
00:04:43,119 --> 00:04:44,319
he doesn't talk much normally,

76
00:04:44,519 --> 00:04:46,239
so I didn't ask too much about his address.

77
00:04:47,860 --> 00:04:48,320
Got it.

78
00:04:48,480 --> 00:04:49,480
Thank you.

79
00:04:55,420 --> 00:04:55,980
I'd like to ask,
is there someone

80
00:04:56,800 --> 00:04:58,260
about my height,

81
00:04:58,500 --> 00:04:59,519
who looks like this,

82
00:04:59,860 --> 00:05:01,219
but with blue hair?

83
00:05:02,519 --> 00:05:03,519
Doesn't ring a bell.

84
00:05:08,440 --> 00:05:09,559
Have you seen a guy

85
00:05:09,800 --> 00:05:10,539
who looks like this?

86
00:05:10,659 --> 00:05:12,280
He's about my height.

87
00:05:14,300 --> 00:05:15,300
Never seen him.

88
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:18,360
Thanks.

89
00:05:20,019 --> 00:05:21,639
Xiao Wu worked really hard.

90
00:05:21,960 --> 00:05:23,400
He's actually a great kid.

91
00:05:23,980 --> 00:05:24,820
Just bad luck.

92
00:05:24,821 --> 00:05:26,078
When those people came to make a scene,

93
00:05:26,079 --> 00:05:27,940
they bullied him so viciously.

94
00:05:28,159 --> 00:05:29,359
We couldn't stand watching it.

95
00:05:29,920 --> 00:05:31,199
But he's too proud,

96
00:05:31,280 --> 00:05:32,655
and didn't want to drag us into it.

97
00:05:32,679 --> 00:05:33,340
The very next day,

98
00:05:33,579 --> 00:05:34,980
he resigned and left on his own.

99
00:05:46,940 --> 00:05:47,940
Hey, Brother Hao.

100
00:05:50,420 --> 00:05:50,920
Teng Mo.

101
00:05:51,380 --> 00:05:52,139
A couple of days ago,
when I went

102
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:54,000
to the hospital,

103
00:05:54,320 --> 00:05:55,360
I bumped into Xiao Wu.

104
00:05:55,980 --> 00:05:56,400
What?

105
00:05:56,980 --> 00:05:57,579
I'm fine.

106
00:05:57,760 --> 00:05:59,900
One of my brothers got
ambushed by some rivals.

107
00:06:01,320 --> 00:06:03,059
When I saw him,

108
00:06:03,260 --> 00:06:04,460
he was carrying takeout boxes.

109
00:06:04,699 --> 00:06:06,139
Probably delivering food to someone.

110
00:06:06,400 --> 00:06:07,555
They were short on stretchers at the time,

111
00:06:07,579 --> 00:06:09,459
and he even helped carry
one of my brothers up.

112
00:06:09,860 --> 00:06:10,559
When was this?

113
00:06:10,800 --> 00:06:11,800
Which hospital?

114
00:06:12,199 --> 00:06:13,239
Just a couple of days ago.

115
00:06:13,340 --> 00:06:14,340
Jinyang Hospital.

116
00:06:15,539 --> 00:06:16,500
I was in such a rush,

117
00:06:16,501 --> 00:06:18,501
I didn't get a chance to
ask which ward he was in.

118
00:06:20,300 --> 00:06:21,300
Understood, Brother Hao.

119
00:06:21,820 --> 00:06:23,320
Thanks, you've been a huge help.

120
00:06:24,539 --> 00:06:25,618
I'll treat you to a meal later.

121
00:06:25,619 --> 00:06:26,079
I'm hanging up now.

122
00:06:26,159 --> 00:06:27,399
I need to head to the hospital.

123
00:06:27,480 --> 00:06:27,920
What?

124
00:06:28,139 --> 00:06:29,320
Sounds like

125
00:06:29,599 --> 00:06:30,900
you're already back in Jinyang.

126
00:06:32,179 --> 00:06:32,860
Well,

127
00:06:32,980 --> 00:06:34,015
it was a last-minute decision.

128
00:06:34,039 --> 00:06:35,079
I just got back yesterday.

129
00:06:35,400 --> 00:06:37,000
I'll explain it to you when I have time.

130
00:06:37,820 --> 00:06:38,820
Alright.

131
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:50,260
Driver, what's going on up ahead?

132
00:06:51,380 --> 00:06:52,380
There's a car crash.

133
00:06:52,440 --> 00:06:53,440
Everything's jammed up.

134
00:06:58,239 --> 00:06:59,780
Roughly how long is the wait?

135
00:07:00,400 --> 00:07:01,400
Who knows?

136
00:07:01,679 --> 00:07:02,980
It'll clear up eventually.

137
00:07:03,360 --> 00:07:04,500
Being in a rush won't help.

138
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:28,320
Excuse me,

139
00:07:28,321 --> 00:07:29,920
is there a patient named Wu Shixian?

140
00:07:30,860 --> 00:07:31,979
He might not be a patient.

141
00:07:31,980 --> 00:07:33,479
He could be a family member.

142
00:07:33,480 --> 00:07:34,679
Anyway, that's the name.

143
00:07:35,500 --> 00:07:36,518
We can't just disclose

144
00:07:36,519 --> 00:07:37,800
patients' private information.

145
00:07:37,940 --> 00:07:40,060
And we definitely don't
keep track of family members.

146
00:07:40,340 --> 00:07:41,139
What exactly are you asking?

147
00:07:41,280 --> 00:07:43,179
Do you have any ID or proof?

148
00:07:46,079 --> 00:07:46,539
No.

149
00:07:47,019 --> 00:07:48,539
You don't even have any ID,

150
00:07:48,679 --> 00:07:49,879
how am I supposed to help you?

151
00:07:50,019 --> 00:07:51,019
If you're looking for someone,

152
00:07:51,020 --> 00:07:52,759
you need to at least
provide the patient's name,

153
00:07:52,760 --> 00:07:54,119
age, and gender,

154
00:07:54,480 --> 00:07:55,560
as well as their diagnosis.

155
00:07:55,739 --> 00:07:58,059
You also need to show visitor credentials.

156
00:07:58,679 --> 00:07:59,679
Do you have any of that?

157
00:08:00,320 --> 00:08:01,320
You're so frantic,

158
00:08:01,321 --> 00:08:03,035
and you haven't even
explained things clearly.

159
00:08:03,059 --> 00:08:04,059
Then,

160
00:08:04,380 --> 00:08:05,678
for patients with pulmonary
arterial hypertension

161
00:08:05,679 --> 00:08:07,876
who need long-term hospitalization,
which department are they in?

162
00:08:07,900 --> 00:08:09,380
It depends on the specific situation.

163
00:08:09,860 --> 00:08:11,799
Only severe cases like heart failure

164
00:08:11,800 --> 00:08:13,160
require long-term hospitalization.

165
00:08:13,940 --> 00:08:15,038
If you're really in a hurry,

166
00:08:15,039 --> 00:08:17,119
go ask at the
cardiovascular inpatient ward.

167
00:08:17,260 --> 00:08:18,260
Okay, thanks.

168
00:08:22,779 --> 00:08:23,779
He needs to deliver food,

169
00:08:23,819 --> 00:08:25,219
which means they're not in the ICU.

170
00:08:25,779 --> 00:08:27,175
Given Shixian's financial situation,

171
00:08:27,199 --> 00:08:28,879
they wouldn't be in a private room either.

172
00:08:29,180 --> 00:08:31,039
Cardiovascular general ward.

173
00:08:32,619 --> 00:08:34,619
Building 3, second floor.

174
00:09:07,300 --> 00:09:08,300
Shixian, don't run!

175
00:09:08,619 --> 00:09:09,619
Shixian!

176
00:09:25,539 --> 00:09:26,260
Keep running, you brat!
Where are you gonna go?

177
00:09:26,899 --> 00:09:27,899
Let go of me!

178
00:09:29,199 --> 00:09:30,579
Let go of me, you old bastard!

179
00:09:31,140 --> 00:09:32,140
Didn't you leave?

180
00:09:32,420 --> 00:09:33,420
Why did you come back?

181
00:09:33,619 --> 00:09:35,300
You just want to see me miserable.

182
00:09:35,460 --> 00:09:36,640
Does that make you happy?

183
00:09:36,739 --> 00:09:37,060
Yes.

184
00:09:37,260 --> 00:09:38,260
I'm thrilled.

185
00:09:38,600 --> 00:09:39,539
Seeing you miserable,
seeing you suffer,

186
00:09:40,280 --> 00:09:41,419
it made me lose my appetite and sleep.

187
00:09:41,420 --> 00:09:42,420
I'm just so thrilled.

188
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:43,600
Shixian.

189
00:09:43,819 --> 00:09:45,140
Look how skinny you've gotten.

190
00:09:45,479 --> 00:09:46,619
Do you think I'm happy?

191
00:09:48,199 --> 00:09:48,720
Stop messing around.

192
00:09:49,039 --> 00:09:50,039
Be good.

193
00:09:54,020 --> 00:09:55,020
What's all this yelling?

194
00:09:56,039 --> 00:09:57,039
This is a hospital.

195
00:09:57,380 --> 00:09:58,860
Don't you know patients need to rest?

196
00:10:02,020 --> 00:10:03,419
Two grown men grabbing at each other.

197
00:10:03,420 --> 00:10:04,420
What a disgrace.

198
00:10:04,539 --> 00:10:05,979
Have you no sense of public decency?

199
00:10:07,659 --> 00:10:09,859
Aren't you the family member
of the patient in bed 107?

200
00:10:10,600 --> 00:10:12,420
Bed 107 is about to have an MRI.

201
00:10:12,520 --> 00:10:13,520
Why are you still here?

202
00:10:13,939 --> 00:10:15,619
Are you going to let the patient go alone?

203
00:10:17,520 --> 00:10:18,520
I'll be right there.

204
00:10:20,060 --> 00:10:21,100
Who are you?

205
00:10:22,739 --> 00:10:24,059
I'm here to visit

206
00:10:24,060 --> 00:10:25,859
the patient in room 107.

207
00:10:27,439 --> 00:10:28,720
Whatever issues you two have,

208
00:10:28,859 --> 00:10:29,859
take it outside.

209
00:10:30,119 --> 00:10:30,859
This is a hospital.

210
00:10:30,860 --> 00:10:32,060
No loud noises allowed.

211
00:10:32,380 --> 00:10:33,140
If you keep arguing,

212
00:10:33,279 --> 00:10:34,319
I'm calling security.

213
00:10:35,220 --> 00:10:36,279
Sorry, we'll keep it down.

214
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:47,000
Sis.

215
00:10:50,119 --> 00:10:51,220
Who is this?

216
00:10:55,760 --> 00:10:56,760
Nobody.

217
00:10:56,840 --> 00:10:57,300
Let's go, Sis.

218
00:10:57,439 --> 00:10:58,439
The doctor is waiting.

219
00:10:58,840 --> 00:11:00,539
All that noise in the hallway just now,

220
00:11:00,939 --> 00:11:01,939
that was you, wasn't it?

221
00:11:02,720 --> 00:11:03,720
No, it wasn't.

222
00:11:05,140 --> 00:11:06,140
Let's go.

223
00:11:13,800 --> 00:11:14,859
Was it because of him?

224
00:11:16,300 --> 00:11:17,119
No, Sis.

225
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:18,280
It really wasn't me just now.

226
00:11:18,680 --> 00:11:19,159
Let's hurry.

227
00:11:19,239 --> 00:11:20,239
The doctor is rushing us.

228
00:11:31,659 --> 00:11:32,859
What are you doing here again?

229
00:11:33,779 --> 00:11:34,460
Since you wanted to leave,

230
00:11:34,560 --> 00:11:35,960
you should have made a clean break.

231
00:11:36,739 --> 00:11:37,859
I have something to ask you.

232
00:11:39,039 --> 00:11:40,199
I have nothing to say to you.

233
00:11:41,340 --> 00:11:42,960
So Wu Yixian is your sister.

234
00:11:43,819 --> 00:11:44,739
Why didn't you tell me?

235
00:11:44,740 --> 00:11:45,920
Why should I tell you?

236
00:11:47,939 --> 00:11:49,459
What do you think our relationship is?

237
00:11:50,359 --> 00:11:52,279
Aren't I just a toy you bought?

238
00:11:52,680 --> 00:11:54,439
Who actually cares about a toy?

239
00:11:55,840 --> 00:11:56,439
I get it.

240
00:11:56,739 --> 00:11:57,579
No, you don't.

241
00:11:57,739 --> 00:11:59,380
What does it matter if I get it or not?

242
00:11:59,460 --> 00:12:00,560
I don't care anymore.

243
00:12:01,119 --> 00:12:02,119
Shixian.

244
00:12:02,539 --> 00:12:03,539
Listen to me.

245
00:12:03,640 --> 00:12:04,640
Sis.

246
00:12:05,539 --> 00:12:06,220
Shixian.

247
00:12:06,560 --> 00:12:07,560
Sis.

248
00:12:07,720 --> 00:12:08,500
What do you want to eat later?
I'll go buy it for you.

249
00:12:09,600 --> 00:12:10,600
Okay?

250
00:12:34,180 --> 00:12:35,180
Shixian.

251
00:12:39,079 --> 00:12:40,020
That gentleman outside,

252
00:12:40,021 --> 00:12:41,239
do you know him?

253
00:12:44,180 --> 00:12:45,180
I don't know him.

254
00:12:46,739 --> 00:12:47,960
If you don't know him,

255
00:12:48,659 --> 00:12:50,319
why does he keep staring at you?

256
00:12:56,640 --> 00:12:57,640
He's crazy.

257
00:13:00,060 --> 00:13:01,119
You're a grown man now.

258
00:13:02,340 --> 00:13:03,819
Stop acting like a child.

259
00:13:04,520 --> 00:13:05,559
He clearly has something
to discuss with you.

260
00:13:05,560 --> 00:13:07,060
Just talk to him properly.

261
00:13:07,539 --> 00:13:09,020
Running away won't solve anything.

262
00:13:10,239 --> 00:13:11,699
I really don't know him, Sis.

263
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:13,220
Stop worrying over nothing.

264
00:13:17,479 --> 00:13:18,999
Did you get into some kind of trouble?

265
00:13:19,520 --> 00:13:21,020
Or did you borrow money from him?

266
00:13:22,220 --> 00:13:24,076
Or are those people who
gave you trouble last time

267
00:13:24,100 --> 00:13:25,100
tracking you down here?

268
00:13:28,340 --> 00:13:28,819
How about this?

269
00:13:29,159 --> 00:13:30,159
Call him in.

270
00:13:30,319 --> 00:13:31,380
I'll have a chat with him.

271
00:13:32,979 --> 00:13:33,380
Sis.

272
00:13:33,381 --> 00:13:34,960
It's really not what you think.

273
00:13:41,920 --> 00:13:42,920
Sis.

274
00:13:43,239 --> 00:13:44,039
Wait for me a second.

275
00:13:44,260 --> 00:13:45,260
I'll be right back.

276
00:13:47,039 --> 00:13:48,039
Go on.

277
00:13:59,300 --> 00:14:00,300
My sister is sick.

278
00:14:00,800 --> 00:14:01,800
Don't bother her here.

279
00:14:02,039 --> 00:14:04,119
If you have something
to say, let's take it outside.

280
00:14:14,600 --> 00:14:15,600
Speak.

281
00:14:16,399 --> 00:14:17,399
What exactly do you want?

282
00:14:19,920 --> 00:14:20,920
I'm sorry.

283
00:14:21,600 --> 00:14:22,119
I...

284
00:14:22,500 --> 00:14:24,600
I left before without saying goodbye.

285
00:14:27,819 --> 00:14:28,819
It's fine.

286
00:14:29,979 --> 00:14:30,979
I don't care.

287
00:14:38,020 --> 00:14:39,020
Are you done?

288
00:14:39,119 --> 00:14:40,239
If you're done, I'm leaving.

289
00:14:40,699 --> 00:14:41,699
Shixian.

290
00:14:42,779 --> 00:14:43,779
What exactly happened?

291
00:14:44,220 --> 00:14:45,220
Let go.

292
00:14:47,439 --> 00:14:48,060
Talk to me properly.

293
00:14:48,260 --> 00:14:49,380
Or I'll kiss you right here.

294
00:14:50,359 --> 00:14:51,359
Don't you dare.

295
00:14:55,840 --> 00:14:56,840
Talk properly.

296
00:15:00,939 --> 00:15:01,939
What's there to ask?

297
00:15:03,340 --> 00:15:04,660
What does it have to do with you?

298
00:15:06,720 --> 00:15:08,000
That incident with the old lady...

299
00:15:08,079 --> 00:15:09,079
I didn't touch her.

300
00:15:10,140 --> 00:15:11,700
I know, they were trying to extort you.

301
00:15:13,039 --> 00:15:14,039
I want to ask you,

302
00:15:14,079 --> 00:15:15,079
did you get hurt?

303
00:15:21,399 --> 00:15:22,399
Shixian.

304
00:15:29,539 --> 00:15:30,340
Have you never thought about

305
00:15:30,341 --> 00:15:31,539
being with a man?

306
00:15:40,079 --> 00:15:41,079
No.

307
00:15:43,560 --> 00:15:45,280
Then why were you willing to sleep with me?

308
00:15:47,760 --> 00:15:48,760
Because I needed money.

309
00:15:48,960 --> 00:15:49,960
Just that?

310
00:15:50,260 --> 00:15:51,260
Yes.

311
00:15:55,439 --> 00:15:56,460
I can explain.

312
00:15:56,579 --> 00:15:57,579
Before,

313
00:15:57,800 --> 00:15:59,476
I left without a word because I thought...

314
00:15:59,500 --> 00:15:59,779
I...

315
00:15:59,780 --> 00:16:01,420
You don't need to explain anything to me.

316
00:16:01,819 --> 00:16:03,139
There's no need for explanations.

317
00:16:05,199 --> 00:16:06,199
I'm not mad.

318
00:16:09,239 --> 00:16:10,239
We were never

319
00:16:10,479 --> 00:16:12,439
in a relationship that
required apologies anyway.

320
00:16:21,979 --> 00:16:22,979
Are you done?

321
00:16:23,560 --> 00:16:24,560
I have things to do.

322
00:16:24,600 --> 00:16:25,915
I don't have time to play games with you.

323
00:16:25,939 --> 00:16:27,340
I'm not playing games with you.

324
00:16:28,000 --> 00:16:29,560
And I never treated you like a toy.

325
00:16:33,220 --> 00:16:34,220
Then let me ask you,

326
00:16:36,152 --> 00:16:38,572
do you think leaving without a word

327
00:16:39,899 --> 00:16:40,899
was cool?

328
00:16:42,420 --> 00:16:43,420
Or noble?

329
00:16:44,739 --> 00:16:45,619
I left because

330
00:16:45,620 --> 00:16:47,540
I saw you trying on
wedding dresses with a girl.

331
00:16:47,779 --> 00:16:49,179
I thought you were getting married.

332
00:16:51,340 --> 00:16:51,920
Shixian.

333
00:16:52,180 --> 00:16:53,199
Give me a chance.

334
00:16:55,039 --> 00:16:56,479
I just hope you won't chase me away.

335
00:16:57,060 --> 00:16:57,800
Let's just leave it at this for now.
Wait until your sister gets better.

336
00:16:58,660 --> 00:16:59,860
Wait until everything is fine.

337
00:17:00,500 --> 00:17:01,979
If you still want me
to leave then, I'll go.

338
00:17:02,140 --> 00:17:02,619
Okay?

339
00:17:03,039 --> 00:17:04,859
In the end, aren't you
still going to leave?

340
00:17:05,840 --> 00:17:06,840
What's the difference?

341
00:17:56,420 --> 00:17:57,420
Dummy.

342
00:17:57,739 --> 00:17:58,739
People are people.

343
00:17:58,979 --> 00:17:59,979
Not diamonds.

344
00:18:00,380 --> 00:18:01,380
Not stones.

345
00:18:02,039 --> 00:18:04,340
Don't let whether others value you
or not make you devalue yourself.

346
00:18:14,979 --> 00:18:15,699
I'm praising you.

347
00:18:15,939 --> 00:18:17,000
You did well today.

348
00:18:17,380 --> 00:18:18,680
You knew how to defend yourself.

349
00:18:18,760 --> 00:18:20,120
And you didn't resort to violence.

350
00:18:20,180 --> 00:18:21,860
It's not like you won't be around anymore.

351
00:18:22,199 --> 00:18:23,616
Are you going to stop caring about me?

352
00:18:23,640 --> 00:18:24,699
That's not what I meant.

353
00:18:25,359 --> 00:18:26,159
What I mean is,

354
00:18:26,319 --> 00:18:27,539
you can't always count on me.

355
00:18:28,140 --> 00:18:30,039
I won't be by your side
every single moment.

356
00:18:30,159 --> 00:18:31,639
What will you do when I'm not around?

357
00:18:42,220 --> 00:18:43,220
Shixian.

358
00:18:43,380 --> 00:18:44,760
Did you not sleep well last night?

359
00:18:45,060 --> 00:18:45,560
No.

360
00:18:45,859 --> 00:18:46,920
I slept pretty well.

361
00:18:47,500 --> 00:18:48,500
Yeah, right.

362
00:18:48,880 --> 00:18:50,939
I heard you tossing and turning.

363
00:18:51,739 --> 00:18:52,279
I...

364
00:18:52,520 --> 00:18:53,600
Did I wake you up?

365
00:18:54,899 --> 00:18:55,899
Not really.

366
00:18:56,619 --> 00:18:58,199
I'm a light sleeper anyway.

367
00:18:58,859 --> 00:19:00,579
There's nothing much to do at the hospital.

368
00:19:00,640 --> 00:19:02,119
Go back and get some proper rest.

369
00:19:02,439 --> 00:19:03,519
I can handle things myself.

370
00:19:05,000 --> 00:19:06,500
Sis, I feel fine.

371
00:19:07,140 --> 00:19:08,620
The doctor will be doing rounds soon.

372
00:19:08,739 --> 00:19:10,019
I'll go buy you breakfast first.

373
00:19:10,119 --> 00:19:12,520
Then I'll go pay the hospital's
advance payment.

374
00:19:13,119 --> 00:19:14,119
Wait for me a bit.

375
00:19:14,979 --> 00:19:15,979
Wait a second.

376
00:19:17,260 --> 00:19:18,699
That gentleman from yesterday...

377
00:19:21,220 --> 00:19:21,640
He left.

378
00:19:22,239 --> 00:19:23,359
After I talked to him,

379
00:19:24,060 --> 00:19:25,180
he probably won't come back.

380
00:19:31,699 --> 00:19:32,699
Sis.

381
00:19:32,960 --> 00:19:33,960
Wait for me a bit.

382
00:19:42,140 --> 00:19:42,520
Morning.

383
00:19:42,920 --> 00:19:43,920
Shixian.

384
00:19:47,779 --> 00:19:48,239
You...

385
00:19:48,439 --> 00:19:50,079
Buns, fried dough sticks, soy milk, eggs,

386
00:19:50,159 --> 00:19:50,979
milk, sandwiches,

387
00:19:51,060 --> 00:19:52,420
Guilin rice noodles, beef noodles.

388
00:19:52,539 --> 00:19:53,996
I didn't know what
your sister likes to eat,

389
00:19:54,020 --> 00:19:55,300
so I bought a bit of everything.

390
00:19:56,539 --> 00:19:57,539
Why don't you ask her?

391
00:20:00,159 --> 00:20:01,159
Did you...

392
00:20:01,739 --> 00:20:03,140
stay here all night, or...

393
00:20:03,800 --> 00:20:04,800
did you just get here?

394
00:20:06,100 --> 00:20:07,100
If I told you.

395
00:20:07,500 --> 00:20:08,899
I didn't go home all night,

396
00:20:09,640 --> 00:20:10,779
would you feel bad for me?

397
00:20:14,500 --> 00:20:15,520
You chose not to go home.

398
00:20:15,579 --> 00:20:16,920
Don't act like I forced you.

399
00:20:18,220 --> 00:20:19,220
I'm not.

400
00:20:19,260 --> 00:20:20,319
I did it willingly.

401
00:20:23,939 --> 00:20:25,699
I need to go pay my
sister's hospital bills.

402
00:20:26,199 --> 00:20:27,199
Stop following me.
